            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36607?u=79d8c114db476a7ecc6328b328f71d9d758368c7&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">You can create an account on the website.  cli generation of accounts is not encouraged.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/npm/statusboard/issues/1069",
            "title": "remove npm adduser",
            "date_modified": "2026-04-15T16:18:25.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-02-24T21:00:50.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "wraithgar",
                "url": "https://github.com/wraithgar"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36607?u=79d8c114db476a7ecc6328b328f71d9d758368c7&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Epic</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">These are the planned breaking changes for npm 12:</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> engines.node update (TBD)</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> New \"npm cli future changes\" issue</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Tracking the release PRs here</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4264588334\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/run-script/issues/266\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/run-script/pull/266/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/run-script/pull/266\">npm/run-script#266</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4264050241\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/init-package-json/issues/351\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/init-package-json/pull/351/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/init-package-json/pull/351\">npm/init-package-json#351</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4270183748\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/npm-packlist/issues/280\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/npm-packlist/pull/280/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/npm-packlist/pull/280\">npm/npm-packlist#280</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4270191012\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/package-json/issues/176\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/package-json/pull/176/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/package-json/pull/176\">npm/package-json#176</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The rest are sub-issues</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/npm/statusboard/issues/1068",
            "title": "npm 12",
            "date_modified": "2026-04-15T16:12:36.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-02-24T20:26:12.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "wraithgar",
                "url": "https://github.com/wraithgar"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36607?u=79d8c114db476a7ecc6328b328f71d9d758368c7&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Epic</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">There are currently only a handful of production dependencies in npm that are outdated.  This is our plan for getting them updated if possible.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">env-paths</code></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>required by <code class=\"notranslate\">node-gyp</code> and will be updated in the next semver major of node-gyp (needs an engines update and is waiting on node 20 EOL I believe.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">iconv-lite</code></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>required through <code class=\"notranslate\">encoding</code> by <code class=\"notranslate\">minipass-fetch</code>.</li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3964342134\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/minipass-fetch/issues/181\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/minipass-fetch/pull/181/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/minipass-fetch/pull/181\">npm/minipass-fetch#181</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">err-code</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">retry</code></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>required by <code class=\"notranslate\">promise-retry</code>, which is used by:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">pacote</code> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3970460329\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/pacote/issues/449\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/pacote/pull/449/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/pacote/pull/449\">npm/pacote#449</a></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">make-fetch-happen</code> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3970444930\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/make-fetch-happen/issues/340\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/make-fetch-happen/pull/340/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/make-fetch-happen/pull/340\">npm/make-fetch-happen#340</a></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">libnpmexec</code> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3970511409\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/cli/issues/9008\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/cli/pull/9008/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/cli/pull/9008\">npm/cli#9008</a></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">@npmcli/git</code> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3970480770\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/npm/git/issues/234\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/npm/git/pull/234/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/npm/git/pull/234\">npm/git#234</a></li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">@sigstore/sign</code> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3986190431\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/sigstore/sigstore-js/issues/1578\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/sigstore/sigstore-js/pull/1578/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/sigstore/sigstore-js/pull/1578\">sigstore/sigstore-js#1578</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>This package appears abandoned and the maintainer has no recent activity in github.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://npm.im/@gar/promise-retry\" rel=\"nofollow\">A fork</a> was made and we are moving to it.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">minipass</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">yallist</code></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>required by <code class=\"notranslate\">minipass-flush</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">minipass-pipeline</code>.</li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3964821086\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/isaacs/minipass-flush/issues/15\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/isaacs/minipass-flush/pull/15/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/isaacs/minipass-flush/pull/15\">isaacs/minipass-flush#15</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3970173759\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/isaacs/minipass-pipeline/issues/17\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/isaacs/minipass-pipeline/pull/17/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/isaacs/minipass-pipeline/pull/17\">isaacs/minipass-pipeline#17</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/npm/statusboard/issues/1065",
            "title": "Outdated cli deps",
            "date_modified": "2026-04-06T16:51:08.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-02-20T20:15:57.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "wraithgar",
                "url": "https://github.com/wraithgar"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36607?u=79d8c114db476a7ecc6328b328f71d9d758368c7&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Epic</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">pacote supports <code class=\"notranslate\">allow-git</code> <code class=\"notranslate\">allow-remote</code>, etc to limit fetching from non-registry endpoints.  npm needs an aggregate flag so folks can configure them in one place.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This will be <code class=\"notranslate\">--allow-type</code> with the values being a loose mapping to npm-package-arg types (registry will be an analog for version/range/tag).</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/npm/statusboard/issues/1064",
